      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur rassemble ses forces et\nlaisse éclater son pouvoir. Peut aussi\nbaisser la Défense Spéciale de l’ennemi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user heightens its mental focus and\nunleashes its power.\nIt may also lower the target’s Sp. Def.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user heightens its mental focus and\nunleashes its power.\nIt may also lower the target’s Sp. Def.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "こんしんの　ちからで　こうげきする。\nあたった　あいての　とくぼうを\nさげることが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "기합을 높여서\n혼신의 힘을 방출한다. 상대의\n특수방어를 떨어뜨릴 때가 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur rassemble ses forces et laisse éclater\nson pouvoir. Peut aussi baisser la Défense\nSpéciale de l’ennemi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Angriff mit aller Macht. Die Spezial-\nVerteidigung des Zieles sinkt eventuell.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Quien lo usa reduce la resistencia que ofrece su\ncuerpo y gana mucho en Velocidad.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa si concentra e rilascia la sua forza.\nPuò ridurre la Difesa Speciale del Pokémon\ncolpito.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user heightens its mental focus and\nunleashes its power.\nThis may also lower the target’s Sp. Def.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "気合を　高めて\nありったけの　力を　放出する。\n相手の　特防を　さげることが　ある。",
